<view class="page">
  <view class="brand">{{appName}}</view>
  <view class="hero">从适合自己的<text class="hero-line">节奏开始。</text></view>
  <view class="muted intro">选择一项运动，为下一次进步做好准备。</view>
  <view class="welcome-card">
    <view class="welcome-label">你的训练，从这里开始</view>
    <view class="welcome-title">今天想练什么？</view>
    <view class="welcome-description">选好运动，开启触屏或光学自由计数。</view>
    <navigator class="button choose-link" url="/pages/exercises/index" hover-class="button-hover">选择训练项目 <text aria-hidden="true">↗</text></navigator>
  </view>
  <view class="section-heading"><text>运动项目</text><text class="muted">最近使用优先</text></view>
  <view class="exercise-grid">
    <navigator wx:for="{{exercises}}" wx:key="id" class="exercise-tile" url="{{item.trainingUrl}}" hover-class="button-hover">
      <view class="tile-top"><text class="tile-number">{{item.number}}</text><text class="type-tag {{item.isTimed ? 'type-timed' : ''}}">{{item.typeLabel}}</text></view>
      <view class="exercise-name">{{item.name}}</view>
      <view class="tile-unit">{{item.unit}} / 组</view>
    </navigator>
  </view>
  <view class="muted availability">光学参数可在设置中实时测试和调节；实际效果待真机验证。平板支撑计时准备中。</view>
  <navigator class="record-link" url="/pages/history/index" open-type="switchTab" hover-class="button-hover">查看训练记录 <text aria-hidden="true">›</text></navigator>
</view>
